ng earlier ones."},{"markdown":"`owo export skill --out <dir>` writes a `SKILL.md` that loads the identity with `owo context` and lists the read and write commands.","startLine":77,"endLine":77,"text":"owo export skill --out <dir> writes a SKILL.md that loads the identity with owo context and lists the read and write commands."},{"markdown":"Host-agnostic session sync: the host calls `sync start` after each turn and `sync done` after a successful ingest run.","startLine":81,"endLine":81,"text":"Host-agnostic session sync: the host calls sync start after each turn and sync done after a successful ingest run."},{"markdown":"`owo sync start --session <id> --transcript <path> [--format jsonl|claude-jsonl|opencode-json] [--every N] [--now]` parses user and assistant text, reads the bookmark in `<root>/.owo/sessions/<id>.json`, and counts new user turns. A run is due at `--every` turns (default `identity.json` `sync_every`, else 6), or at any new turn with `--now`.","startLine":83,"endLine":83,"text":"owo sync start --session <id> --transcript <path> [--format jsonl|claude-jsonl|opencode-json] [--every N] [--now] parses user and assistant text, reads the bookmark in <root>/.owo/sessions/<id>.json, and counts new user turns. A run is due at --every turns (default identity.json sync_every, else 6), or at any new turn with --now."},{"markdown":"When due it writes the slice, with two earlier user turns as overlap, to `<root>/sources/<slug>/<date>_<session>_<from>-<until>.md`, and the ingest prompt to `.owo/sessions/<id>.prompt.md`. `owo sync done --session <id> --until <n>` moves the bookmark forward; `--until` may not pass the message count the last `sync start` read. The prompt names the absolute root and runs `context --no-touch`, so ingest runs do not count as project sessions. `--project` must name an existing project. A file with no user or assistant messages for the chosen format fails. While a run is pending, a not-due `sync start` names its prompt.","startLine":85,"e